text = "Roll the ball to the golden finish pad.
Collect all gems. Checkpoints save you.

PC: WASD / Arrows to move, Space to jump,
R restarts at checkpoint, Esc pauses.
Right-drag orbits the camera.

Mobile: left joystick moves, JUMP button jumps."
